@startuml question_set
!include style.iuml
title A question set: from a source's sections to settled pairs

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
hide footbox

actor Person
participant "Stand\n(jobs)" as Stand
participant "Generator\n(questioning, cloud)" as Gen
participant "Reader\n(accepting, local)" as Reader
participant "Judge\n(judging)" as Judge
database "Base\n(question rows)" as Base

Person -> Stand : set name, languages,\na smoke cap first
alt the stand writes the pairs
  Stand -> Stand : generate_questions:\nexport the source's sections,\nquota spread by words
  loop each section, block by block
    Stand -> Gen : the block and the pairs\nthe section already holds
    Gen --> Stand : pairs: a question per language\nand its evidence
    Stand -> Stand : checks in code: evidence is\nthe section's words, language,\nno heading echo, no page reference
    Stand -> Base : kept pairs as candidates,\neach with its exact gold section
  end
else pairs written outside
  Person -> Stand : sources/questions/<set>.jsonl,\nwritten by a person or an agent
  Stand -> Base : load_questions:\nevery row a candidate
end
Stand -> Reader : accept_questions: each question\nwith its gold section, no answer shown
Reader --> Stand : a quote from the section, or none
Stand -> Base : accepted when both quotes hold the evidence,\nrefused when neither answers,\nopen otherwise
Stand -> Judge : judge_questions: the open pairs\nwith the passage around the evidence
Judge --> Stand : YES or NO per half
Stand -> Base : the open pairs settled
Stand -> Base : anchor_questions: identifiers\nthe question names and its section holds
@enduml
